{title: Chain Se Humko Kabhi}
{artist: Asha Bhosle O P Nayyar}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D] [A] [D]
chain se hamako kabhii aapane jiine na diya
[D] [G] [A] [D]
zahar bhii chaahaa agar, piinaa to piine naa diya
[D],        chain se hamko kabhii
[D] [A] [G]
chaand ke rath men raat kii dulhan jab jab aaegii
[D] [A] [G]
yaad hamaarii aapake dil ko tarasaa jaaegii
[D] [A] [D]
aapane jo hai diyaa, vo to kisiine naa diyaa
[D] [G] [A] [D]
zahar bhii chaahaa agar, piinaa to piine naa diyaa
[D],        chain se
